"""Training data and held-out questions for the P1.7 fine-tuning, generated by Python from the
agent's deterministic tools (D10): no teacher model, no hand labels.

For every question the generator plans the tool calls a correct run makes, with each result
computed by the agent's own run_tool, then runs the plan through the agent's own loop
(agent_runtime.loop.run_task) with a scripted LLM, in each D10 mode. A training example is what the
runtime sent the model at one step plus the reply the plan gives there, so prompts, tool definitions
and tool results are exactly the runtime's. Held-out questions are written in go_no_go's Question
shape for experiments/heldout.py, on CSVs and names training never sees.

Writes train.jsonl and heldout.jsonl to the directory data_dir names.

Usage: finetune_data.py EXPERIMENT_YAML
"""

